345
00:25:26,041 --> 00:25:27,871
Come on, I'll help.
We can make it.

346
00:25:27,905 --> 00:25:30,287
I'll just sleep in
your bed tonight.

347
00:25:30,321 --> 00:25:32,082
It's fine.
You won't even notice I'm there

348
00:25:32,116 --> 00:25:33,704
