still sleeper.

349
00:25:33,739 --> 00:25:34,947
Like a rock. Look.

350
00:25:40,746 --> 00:25:41,850
Okay.

351
00:28:01,783 --> 00:28:03,509
I was wondering, if you might
like to join me

352
00:28:03,543 --> 00:28:04,752
for church this morning.

353
00:28:04,786 --> 00:28:05,856
It's a short service.

354
00:28:07,168 --> 00:28:08,272
That'd be okay.

355
00:28:08,307 --> 00:28:09,273
Oh, great.

356
00:28:10,447 --> 00:28:11,448
Morning.

357
00:28:12,345 --> 00:28:14,002
Good morning.

358
00:28:14,520 --> 00:28:18,248
I'm going to borrow this for a
couple days, if you don't mind.

359
00:28:18,282 --> 00:28:20,733
Actually, I was going to give
it to Winthrop for his room.

360
00:28:20,768 --> 00:28:22,010
Oh, he can manage.

361
00:28:22,045 --> 00:28:24,323
I just need to get my heat
turned back on.

362
00:28:25,048 --> 00:28:26,118
<i>Toodles!</i>

363
00:28:30,260 --> 00:28:31,261
Here we are.

364
00:28:39,027 --> 00:28:40,097
Good morning.

365
00:28:40,822 --> 00:28:42,065
That man?

366
00:28:42,099 --> 00:28:43,100
He scared me
to death last night.

367
00:28:43,135 --> 00:28:45,275
He showed up on my porch
at 2:00 in the morning.

368
00:28:45,551 --> 00:28:47,139
I had to get my husband's gun.

369
00:28:47,553 --> 00:28:49,106
I thought
he was going to break in.

370
00:28:49,141 --> 00:28:50,245
What are you talking about?

371
00:28:50,280 --> 00:28:51,453
You're okay.

372
00:28:51,488 --> 00:28:52,903
Everybody's okay.

373
00:28:53,283 --> 00:28:54,491
Let's go inside.

374
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:05,744
Would it be okay if I stay
in the car?

375
00:29:07,159 --> 00:29:08,194
Of course.

376
00:29:15,236 --> 00:29:17,031
Hi Don.

377
00:29:18,653 --> 00:29:22,243
<i>...and Jacob said to Joseph,
go and see the world</i>

378
00:29:22,277 --> 00:29:24,003
