381
00:29:29,837 --> 00:29:31,562
<i>and to weaken this idea
among men.</i>

382
00:29:32,184 --> 00:29:33,288
<i>Why?</i>

383
00:29:33,323 --> 00:29:34,876
<i>The Bible tells us this, too.</i>

384
00:29:34,911 --> 00:29:36,947
<i>Because it was more dangerous
to him</i>

385
00:29:36,982 --> 00:29:38,224
<i>than anything that--</i>

386
00:29:54,102 --> 00:29:55,207
Winthrop.

387
00:29:57,312 --> 00:30:00,108
You can't disappear
