I didn't mean to scare anybody.

392
00:30:16,538 --> 00:30:18,609
Maybe it was sick or something.

393
00:30:19,990 --> 00:30:21,198
I tried to save it.

394
00:30:27,411 --> 00:30:29,344
You've always done this,
