Your uncle...

410
00:33:19,169 --> 00:33:21,723
keeping you in that cage.

411
00:33:24,105 --> 00:33:25,106
Now, now...

412
00:33:29,524 --> 00:33:31,837
Don't go losing your head.

413
00:33:31,871 --> 00:33:33,804
<i>John! John!</i>

414
00:33:42,296 --> 00:33:43,366
Who are you?

415
