I brought you some food.

416
00:34:06,492 --> 00:34:07,769
Feeling any better?

417
00:34:12,740 --> 00:34:15,467
It's been three days.
I'm going to call the doctor.

418
00:34:17,469 --> 00:34:19,091
God, it's cold in here.

419
00:34:25,925 --> 00:34:28,238
Tomorrow, I'm not
taking no for an answer.

420
00:34:28,583 --> 00:34:31,552
I'm going to drive up and
get that heater back from Vahna.

421
00:34:33,209 --> 00:34:34,624
Do you need anything
before I go?

422
