430
00:36:45,410 --> 00:36:48,378
Oh, no. I'm okay.
I have someone staying with me.

431
00:36:48,413 --> 00:36:49,483
Thank you.

432
00:36:49,517 --> 00:36:50,932
Good, yeah.

433
00:36:51,312 --> 00:36:53,659
Well, I think you've had more
