434
00:36:53,694 --> 00:36:55,696
so I'm gonna save my questions
for the morning, okay?

435
00:36:56,904 --> 00:36:58,285
- Thank you.
- All right.

436
00:37:16,855 --> 00:37:17,856
Oh.

437
00:37:18,581 --> 00:37:20,755
Vahna's... dead.

438
00:37:25,346 --> 00:37:26,382
She, uh...

439
00:37:28,694 --> 00:37:31,766
was beaten to death
it looked like.

440
00:37:33,354 --> 00:37:35,667
Why would anyone
want to do that?

441
00:37:38,739 --> 00:37:40,499
Since, unfortunately,

442
00:37:40,534 --> 00:37:42,743
you might be the last person
to see her alive

443
00:37:42,777 --> 00:37:44,469
and the one who found her body,

444
00:37:45,021 --> 00:37:47,782
would you mind if we take
a look around the house?

445
00:37:47,817 --> 00:37:48,611
Strictly routine.

446
00:37:48,645 --> 00:37:50,889
No, not at all.
Whatever you need.

447
00:37:51,683 --> 00:37:52,684
Now, you mentioned

448
00:37:52,718 --> 00:37:55,031
you went to Vahna Minter's house
