449
00:37:55,859 --> 00:37:57,067
She borrowed mine,

450
00:37:57,102 --> 00:37:59,346
said she was going to bring
it back in a couple of days,

451
00:37:59,380 --> 00:38:00,968
but I hadn't heard from her
in over a week.

452
00:38:08,009 --> 00:38:09,321
And is this the heater?

453
00:38:10,391 --> 00:38:11,599
Uh yes, that's it?

454
00:38:15,569 --> 00:38:17,018
Is that a neighbor?
Who's that?

455
00:38:17,536 --> 00:38:20,056
That's my cousin, Winthrop.
He's staying with me.

456
00:38:20,090 --> 00:38:21,437
Does he know Vahna?

457
00:38:22,438 --> 00:38:24,543
She came over to the house
a couple of times,

458
00:38:24,578 --> 00:38:25,579
had dinner with us.

459
00:38:25,613 --> 00:38:26,787
Spent the night once.

460
00:38:27,546 --> 00:38:28,961
