461
00:38:28,996 --> 00:38:32,517
It was raining and she didn't
feel well,

462
00:38:32,551 --> 00:38:33,759
so I offered
to drive her home, but...

463
00:38:38,419 --> 00:38:41,319
Okay, well, what's, uh,
Winthrop's full name.

464
00:38:43,700 --> 00:38:47,014
Oh, Winthrop Thomas Benson.

465
00:38:48,464 --> 00:38:51,536
And was he here with you last
Tuesday or Wednesday night?

466
00:38:52,606 --> 00:38:53,814
He's always here.

467
00:38:56,161 --> 00:38:57,335
Detective?

468
00:38:58,612 --> 00:38:59,716
Excuse me.

469
00:39:15,525 --> 00:39:17,838
