473
00:39:24,707 --> 00:39:25,639
Sure.

474
00:39:25,846 --> 00:39:27,054
Have a good day, ma'am.

475
00:39:37,892 --> 00:39:38,997
Officer.

476
00:39:39,653 --> 00:39:40,861
Have a good day, sir.

477
00:39:40,895 --> 00:39:41,896
Thank you.

478
00:39:55,254 --> 00:39:56,428
Thanks for coming in.

479
00:39:56,463 --> 00:39:58,672
Oh, thank you for making
time for me, I appreciate it.

480
00:39:58,706 --> 00:39:59,811
- No problem.
- Thanks.

481
00:40:07,163 --> 00:40:08,509
Detective Rausch.

482
00:40:11,063 --> 00:40:12,686
Okay. Yeah.

483
00:40:15,240 --> 00:40:16,655
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

484
00:40:44,545 --> 00:40:46,789
I hear you like to take walks
late at night.

485
00:40:47,548 --> 00:40:51,483
Sometimes I can't sleep
and I get nightmares

486
00:40:51,518 --> 00:40:52,553
so I walk.

487
00:40:53,589 --> 00:40:56,488
The coroner says Vahna Minter
most likely died

488
00:40:56,523 --> 00:40:58,007
sometime Tuesday night.

489
00:40:58,041 --> 00:40:59,180
Were you out walking then?

490
00:40:59,215 --> 00:41:00,906
You see anything strange?

491
00:41:05,566 --> 00:41:07,016
