492
00:41:07,050 --> 00:41:10,675
<i>Records of several fights,
one with an officer.</i>

493
00:41:11,572 --> 00:41:12,780
And this one here.

494
00:41:13,885 --> 00:41:16,681
Looks like you nearly
beat this man to death.

495
00:41:16,715 --> 00:41:18,268
Lost vision in his right eye.

496
00:41:18,303 --> 00:41:19,235
Mhm, mhm, mhm.

497
00:41:20,857 --> 00:41:22,583
You want to talk to me about it?

498
00:41:30,833 --> 00:41:31,903
Listen, Winthrop

499
00:41:33,145 --> 00:41:34,215
I was in Kuwait.

500
00:41:35,769 --> 00:41:37,149
Two tours.

501
00:41:37,667 --> 00:41:40,290
I know the shit you see
when you close your eyes, okay?

502
00:41:40,325 --> 00:41:41,533
I've been there.

503
00:41:41,568 --> 00:41:43,017
But I'm gonna need you
to talk to me.

504
00:41:48,229 --> 00:41:51,301
All right.
You want to play hardball?

505
00:41:51,336 --> 00:41:52,820
Let's play hardball.

506
00:41:53,269 --> 00:41:54,960
I see you had
an accident at the base.

507
00:41:56,962 --> 00:41:58,723
