514
00:42:14,083 --> 00:42:15,015
No!

515
00:42:22,816 --> 00:42:26,095
This mitt is one half of a pair.

516
00:42:26,129 --> 00:42:28,960
One of which was found in
Vahna Minter's kitchen,

517
00:42:28,994 --> 00:42:32,204
and the other of which
