in your room.

520
00:42:39,177 --> 00:42:40,799
Excuse me.
Who are you?

521
00:42:41,835 --> 00:42:44,216
I'm Ellen Hershbergen.
That's my cousin.

522
00:42:44,251 --> 00:42:45,908
Oh, I see.

523
00:42:45,942 --> 00:42:47,357
Actually, I wouldn't mind
asking you

524
00:42:47,392 --> 00:42:48,876
