if you're willing

525
00:42:48,911 --> 00:42:50,188
to come down to the DA's office.

526
00:42:50,222 --> 00:42:51,154
Of course.

527
00:42:57,954 --> 00:43:00,163
Winthrop Benson,
we are placing you under arrest

528
00:43:00,198 --> 00:43:01,233
for the murder-
